  "conventions": {
    "tower_serialisation": "The annexes print EVERY coefficient of the 1-2-4-12 tower in DESCENDING index order; GmSSL-JS stores them ascending. fp2 -> (a1||a0); fp12 -> full reversal i=2..0, j=1..0, k=1..0. Established from the printed P2 (L1138-1142), then confirmed on six 768-hex-char Fp12 blocks.",
    "engine_affine_precondition": "GmSSL-JS point_add / twist_point_add read their SECOND operand as affine and ignore its Z; sm9_pairing reads its G1 argument as affine and calls twist_point_add on its G2 argument. point_mul / twist_point_mul RETURN Jacobian points. Normalise with point_get_affine / twist_point_get_affine before composing, or the result is silently off-curve.",
    "mac": "GM/T 0044.4 §5.4.5: MAC(K2, Z) = Hv(Z || K2) -- message first, key second.",
    "hid": "Encryption hid = 0x03, derived from the annex's own ID_B||hid minus ID_B (not transcribed)."
  },
