    "failure_semantics": "GM/T 0044.4 §7.2.1: B1 verify C1 in G1 (else error); B2 pairing; B3 KDF, error if K1' = 0; B4 u = MAC(K2', C2), if u != C3 report an error and exit; B5 output M'. The C3 check at B4 is what makes public key encryption fail closed -- the KEM has no equivalent.",
